WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.806
Thirteen thousand, two hundred and forty-one.

00:00:02.806 --> 00:00:03.465
Dead.

00:00:03.465 --> 00:00:04.625
In one year.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:07.545
More Canadians killed by MAID than by suicide.

00:00:07.545 --> 00:00:13.477
Nearly five percent of every single death in Canada is now the government pushing a needle into someone's arm.
